              "norman et al. 2019 perturb-seq",
              "replogle et al. 2022 perturb-seq"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "method",
            "values": [
              "cpa | existing deep learning-based model for perturbation prediction used as baseline.",
              "gears | graph-enhanced gene activation and repression simulator gears integrates deep learning with a knowledge graph of gene-gene relationships gene coexpression graph and gene ontology-derived perturbation graph . each gene is represented by a gene embedding and a perturbation embedding processed via gnns. predicts postperturbation gene expression using a cross-gene mlp layer and gene-specific mlp layers.",
              "gene regulatory network grn baseline | baseline model that infers a gene regulatory network and linearly propagates perturbation effects adapted from celloracle .",
              "no perturbation baseline | baseline model that assumes no change in gene expression after perturbation."
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "values": [
              "gears model development and evaluation"
            ]
          },
