              "pearson correlation between predicted and true differential expression",
              "precision 10 for genetic interaction subtypes",
              "top ten accuracy for genetic interaction subtypes"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "task",
            "values": [
              "applying gears to predict outcomes of all pairwise combinations of 102 genes from norman et al. 2019.",
              "predicting non-additive combinatorial perturbation effects synergy suppression neomorphism redundancy epistasis .",
